# Stage 6 / Phase 1 — bidirectionality verification log

Method (per family): apply a surgical BREAK to the source under test, run the
targeted suite to confirm a GENUINE failure that NAMES the new test(s), then
restore the source and confirm the suite is green again. A test that stays green
under its own break would be vacuous; every family below fails loudly when its
invariant is broken and passes once restored.

Baseline before this phase: 395 passing. After: 425 passing (+30).

Families exercised:
  - parse branch-1 (constant draw: Constructor 4MW / Miner Mk1 5MW)
  - parse branch-2 (variable midpoint: Particle Accelerator 875 = (250+1500)/2)
  - parse branch-3 (generator zero-draw, present-as-0)
  - version stale (CATALOG_PARSER_VERSION 1→2 discards v1 rows)
  - export shape (exportPlan returns the stored/migrated v2 JSON)
  - import name guard + collision (trim, empty-refusal, trimmed-form match)

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

